  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WMC 205.04 Opening the Proceeding. The presiding officer at an appeal hearing or prehearing conference shall open the proceeding by describing in general terms the purpose of the proceeding and the general procedures governing its conduct.\n\nSource. #8031, eff 1-24-04",
